# Lines 9, 11, 13 (Pos > 0, <> 0, = 0) -> Contains and 15 (Pos = 1) ->
# StartsStr must fire. Lines 17 (> 1), 19 (= 2), 21 (other function), 23
# (already Contains) must not.
# Known FP shape: Pos with a 3rd offset argument (PosEx semantics) and AnsiPos;
# Pos on a non-string via custom overloads.
pos-for-contains 9
pos-for-contains 11
pos-for-contains 13
pos-for-contains 15
!pos-for-contains 17
!pos-for-contains 19
!pos-for-contains 21
!pos-for-contains 23
!pos-for-contains 25
